<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns all secondary auctions.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns all secondary auctions.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico assigned both auctions whereby it had sought to drain 942 million pesos from the secondary market, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were assigned as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM     AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>    471 million    3 days   23.49 pct</p>
<p>    471 million    1 day    23.59 pct</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9554))</p>
</text>
